   "why": "Afflicted Deserter is a double-faced card, so Cackling Counterpart makes a token that also has both faces. While the front face is up the token is named Afflicted Deserter; Moonmist then turns both the original and the token into Werewolf Ransacker. A single-faced copy would keep the front-face name.",
